#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to rest"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/rest.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>rest</application> package contains a library that was "
"designed to make it easier to access web services that claim to be "
"\"RESTful\". It includes convenience wrappers for libsoup and libxml to make"
" remote usage of the RESTful API easier."
msgstr ""

